      "side": 1,
      "message": "[optional] Would it make sense to make this parameter more generic, e.g. \"label.\u003cLABEL_NAME\u003e.copyEnforcement\", so that host admins could also configure copy enforcements for other labels if they want?\n\nEven if the implementation doesn\u0027t work for other labels yet, it would be good to be able to extend this for other labels later.",
